[{"title":"赴丹阳广福寺与弟言别","author":"皇甫汸","text":"古寺碑题西晋年，澄湖如练倚窗前。\n寒云自覆金光殿，荒草犹埋玉乳泉。\n枫叶染霜秋后色，雨花和梵夜中禅。\n亦知阅水同观世，不奈潮声送客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮北寄故园兄楚邦弟","author":"皇甫汸","text":"晚从吏役自堪嗤，况是人情重别离。\n冰雪寒深南尽地，江山风似旧游时。\n花知吴苑春回早，雁忆衡阳信到迟。\n为说朝中方贵少，白头郎署不相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张尚宝谪淮南转运","author":"皇甫汸","text":"繁华自昔数扬州，君去无嗟夺凤游。\n试访名花吊隋苑，好攀丛桂对淮流。\n河桥月上开官舍，海县潮回放客舟。\n年少辟疆犹作吏，功成谁复念留侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴纯叔夏日即事","author":"皇甫汸","text":"江城五月飒如秋，带雨潮声咽更流。\n尘满空梁闻燕语，烟销残树见花愁。\n登楼自可悲双鬓，临俎谁将献一筹。\n却忆题诗李嘉祐，独缘烽火叹长洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华寺咏落花","author":"皇甫汸","text":"缀幌沾筵各有因，长安万树总辞春。\n残妆带雨犹含泣，薄质随风易损神。\n信断御沟争似叶，香消清路不如尘。\n朝逢鹿女衔将献，证却从前色误身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻报纪事","author":"皇甫汸","text":"五楼钟鼓不闻扬，三殿同灾特异常。\n凭玉须颁罪己诏，止车应受直臣章。\n尧心自是安茨室，汉祀何能救柏梁。\n遥想千官趋走地，却于西内拜君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘谏议畿","author":"皇甫汸","text":"经年尺素未曾题，长夏郊居懒自宜。\n北虏尘飞榆塞日，西京灰满柏梁时。\n中朝望属阳司谏，左掖吟怜杜拾遗。\n定有封章回圣主，莫须焚草避人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武林追忆子安","author":"皇甫汸","text":"曾见褰帷向越城，非关为吏厌承明。\n身随零露朝先尽，恨落江潮夜未平。\n芳草不传池上梦，薇花犹系省中情。\n湖心诸寺闻题遍，留取山僧护姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱江夕泛舟人因指括苍感赋","author":"皇甫汸","text":"冬霁寒轻树未凋，丹枫江岸似花饶。\n半帆布影悬初月，几处渔灯点落潮。\n慢世不将辞赋卖，端居何用简书招。\n白云东望苍山路，曾记当年误折腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻报","author":"皇甫汸","text":"已报旱云连蓟北，更看洪水涨江东。\n天高未鉴桑林祷，河决难成瓠子功。\n周制备荒储九载，汉家闻异策三公。\n小臣亦愿输余税，却奈归田岁不丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春漫兴","author":"皇甫汸","text":"春迟今岁因逢闰，独往寻春春望赊。\n日午阴崖初散雪，夜深微雨乍催花。\n星桥已见收灯市，山郭频闻觅酒家。\n自是金阊嘉丽地，不缘兵火减繁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王子往会稽展袁相公墓因有此赠","author":"皇甫汸","text":"平津高阁已成丘，一道寒泉万木秋。\n秘器尽□□□□，□□□禁故恩留。\n碑题黄绢门人撰，草积青箱汉使收。\n非是羊□□□□，□□□涕洒西州。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严公解相还豫章追送淞陵作二首 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"古来开阁自平津，几见功成得奉身。\n逸老特蒙优诏赐，乞骸何用屡书陈。\n东都饮饯辞供帐，南驿乘符速去轮。\n归到宜春酒应熟，散金惟欲会乡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严公解相还豫章追送淞陵作二首 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"明时扈圣廿年余，始得衔恩谢直庐。\n秀水池台非旧筑，钤冈花径是新除。\n县家岁给山公粟，门巷高悬薛氏车。\n舟泊吴江秋乍冷，野人聊为献鲈鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"史子示袁州诗亦赋","author":"皇甫汸","text":"闻君独抱感时心，说却袁州恨不禁。\n华屋春寒无处燕，沙堤日暮只啼禽。\n尚思祸起骖乘晚，犹道恩过赐剑深。\n诗报茂陵堪下泪，莫将吟入雍门琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"皇甫汸","text":"魂去何须梦，情来即是思。\n非缘怅兹夜，翻似恨当时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得有所思","author":"皇甫汸","text":"锦席承君宴，青楼寄妾家。\n无因挽红袖，留恨与桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月十五夜子浚兄灯宴再赋 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"再吐金枝焰，重开玉树花。\n非关耽夜饮，直是眷年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月十五夜子浚兄灯宴再赋 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"影缕交花艳，明珠减月辉。\n君能留顾盼，时得奉芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西天寺（傍即虢国墓）","author":"皇甫汸","text":"弥勒禅林雨，将军陇树烟。\n长安今罢笑，留恨向西天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题美人蕉","author":"皇甫汸","text":"带雨红妆湿，迎风翠袖翻。\n欲知心不卷，迟暮独无言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄侍","author":"皇甫汸","text":"遇花思舞夜，睹柳忆颦时。\n可道钱江上，行云有梦知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花水仙","author":"皇甫汸","text":"弄影俱宜水，飘香不辨风。\n霓裳承舞处，长在月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题茉莉二首 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"萼密聊承叶，藤轻易绕枝。\n素华堪饰鬘，争趁晚妆时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题茉莉二首 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"香惯临风细，花偏映日生。\n若将人试拟，小玉定齐名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅子铺题壁","author":"皇甫汸","text":"月明清露下荒台，木落空山更可哀。\n夜壑常留金碗在，春风曾识翠华来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月答子浚兄见怀诸弟之作","author":"皇甫汸","text":"南北何如汉二京，迢迢吴越两乡情。\n谢家楼上清秋月，分作关山几处明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"皇甫汸","text":"承恩怜故亦怜新，落叶随风笑此身。\n陌上相逢厮养妇，宫中曾是旧才人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"进酒词","author":"皇甫汸","text":"芳情惯向歌前结，郁抱遍从醉后开。\n何事酒乾衔不放，杯香暗送口脂来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠金医","author":"皇甫汸","text":"少年学道出长桑，闭户时窥五色方。\n汉武甘泉初铸鼎，好将灵药献君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏赠发","author":"皇甫汸","text":"宝髻斜安堕马妆，偷将鸾剪试分香。\n缠君玉腕劳相忆，底是春心如许长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过北川桥旧寓","author":"皇甫汸","text":"客舍依然禁御西，女墙淮月古青溪。\n春风为笑堂前燕，门外何曾识马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲四首和子安兄 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"风吹芳树已凋残，却放清晖入画阑。\n莫道金闺常自暖，夜深翻似玉门寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲四首和子安兄 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"淡烟和月出霜林，落尽寒花只素阴。\n别有兰缸凝彩焰，镜台斜倚照冰心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲四首和子安兄 其三","author":"皇甫汸","text":"绣户深沉半掩门，玉窗愁对月黄昏。\n闲垂翠帐何曾寐，熏尽金笼总不温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲四首和子安兄 其四","author":"皇甫汸","text":"年随流水去伤神，催入风光一度新。\n何事蛾眉颦不展，玉颜无伴怕逢春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永兴寺散步","author":"皇甫汸","text":"帝城西觅古丛林，万木寒垂六月阴。\n庭下闲花斋后偈，门前空水定时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安平元夕对闽客作","author":"皇甫汸","text":"邑少弦歌惟戍鼓，村无烟火只渔灯。\n吴趋彩艳闽珠灿，一样思归两未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄忆","author":"皇甫汸","text":"江东烽火已难知，乱后那堪更别离。\n纵有乡书传驿使，开缄不省是何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘江词三首 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"白涧流残青嶂开，鸡公岭带夕阳来。\n更闻江水盘千曲，何似愁肠日九回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘江词三首 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"攒峰夹岸若云稠，下有飞泉一线流。\n春草深时多瘴厉，行人驻马不堪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6915,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘江词三首 其三","author":"皇甫汸","text":"松风万壑引盘涡，闻唱《公无此渡河》。\n汉将西征遗垒在，至今啼血染沧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6916,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和子约夏日郊居","author":"皇甫汸","text":"炎日遥从瘴岭还，新开幽径竹林间。\n南中六月浑无暑，犹记衙斋对雪山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6917,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八夜儿楙治酒邀诸父待月始阴仍霁","author":"皇甫汸","text":"清夜欢游忽作阴，少时斜月复开林。\n倩教丝竹陶余兴，莫惜儿曹解此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6918,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过张子不值","author":"皇甫汸","text":"偶随明月过君家，幽径无人自落花。\n书帙乱抛青玉案，尚余萤火挂窗纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6919,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次子约答宾","author":"皇甫汸","text":"闭户无营懒逢宜，逃名渐觉少人知。\n相逢陌上休相问，二陆今非入洛时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6920,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬子约","author":"皇甫汸","text":"东吾达命爱都捐，最是忧心易损年。\n头白逢春能几许，且收双泪向花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6921,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴文部园中观秋千二首 其一","author":"皇甫汸","text":"彩架朱丝荡碧空，翩翩双蝶逐花丛。\n祗知神女能行雨，不道仙姬会御风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6922,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴文部园中观秋千二首 其二","author":"皇甫汸","text":"乍起花间渐出墙，只愁人远但闻香。\n娇容愿倩风为力，故制湘裙特许长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长兄斋中尝畜白鹦鹉一只亡后归之于人","author":"皇甫汸","text":"客到花间问主人，隔帘先听语声频。\n今来却作乌衣燕，飞向东家别哢春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赴洛留别华阳兄","author":"皇甫濂","text":"浮云薄高山，崇朝去还结。\n游子不惮烦，悠悠复徂辙。\n密亲自兹旷，临流何能发。\n衰林动远风，寒江冒轻雪。\n遇物隆所悲，兴愁顿难绝。\n无以赴洛人，怀哉但吟越。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思行","author":"皇甫濂","text":"怅忆山中暮，佳期渺未归。\n蘼芜含露叶，杨柳乱烟晖。\n离瑟开尘匣，余香卷夜衣。\n愁心不及鸟，犹逐白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼子乘二首 其一","author":"皇甫濂","text":"肇汝方既诞，发祥良在兹。\n慧敏标弱龄，圭璋渺前期。\n服志远鄙俗，规行多惠仪。\n性成亶纯孝，疗母宁捐躯。\n母患乃始平，子先朝露摧。\n慈爱二纪中，瞥若冲飙驰。\n虚位委空馆，胤类无孑遗。\n天道苟不虚，在数安可推。\n沉忧达晨暮，仿佛盈人思。\n翰墨芳余迹，形音恍当时。\n起居常若随，顾影独无依。\n周遑损眠食，惊惕长分乖。\n魂来或形梦，路绝徒哀悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼子乘二首 其二","author":"皇甫濂","text":"溟溟雨露集，熙熙岁始更。\n灵蠢各有化，人理独无生。\n念我泉下子，一绝如朝荣。\n生男以待终，胡为遘夭茕。\n天夺良以速，安贵颜仁名。\n清尘布虚室，寒晦凝轩屏。\n宿草旅庭荐，哀鸟为悲鸣。\n怅恍鲤趋日，礼训犹用情。\n流目无存形，涕泪交沾缨。\n恫忧何能已，叹息每遗声。\n堂闱旷綦迹，诗书空复盈。\n奚但肠九回，心膂成颓崩。\n愧乏延陵达，无乃伤吾明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"持诵维摩诘品作妙伽它赞四首 其一","author":"皇甫濂","text":"敷涂尽种种，诸法亦何常。\n菩提植净本，蕴此妙观方。\n旋轮众冥息，普我无量光。\n求彼意识界，一与颂灯王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"持诵维摩诘品作妙伽它赞四首 其二","author":"皇甫濂","text":"意彼空中真，毕竟空是疾。\n爱想岂慧摄，权解乃善律。\n应观诸法身，生灭孰虚实。\n愿奉饶益情，不得起厌逸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"持诵维摩诘品作妙伽它赞四首 其三","author":"皇甫濂","text":"驰电非久炬，瞥火现青华。\n五通成达仙，道品登三车。\n庵罗列宝树，恒河泛金沙。\n怖碍允都捐，是证生者涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"持诵维摩诘品作妙伽它赞四首 其四","author":"皇甫濂","text":"染著悉尘根，新故相因续。\n情波无端极，苾刍伤自促。\n但弘法苑慈，藉佛摄神足。\n一济解脱津，永宴净茵蓐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿昌平","author":"皇甫濂","text":"向夕投山界，城临万壑秋。\n丽谯岚气匝，残戍野烟收。\n霜薄低寒雁，风长韵素楸。\n迢迢星斗夜，应共古今愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元真观","author":"皇甫濂","text":"列馆成恬旷，垂轩坐息机。\n未须人境远，已觉世尘违。\n筠密秋生院，花残日背扉。\n谁将示冲漠，予意正忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过陈与竹草庐","author":"皇甫濂","text":"落日衡门下，寒容一水开。\n最怜忘世老，终愧泣歧才。\n野草知年事，邻辉觉暮哀。\n谁能闻嗜酒，时遣白衣来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真州留别华阳兄","author":"皇甫濂","text":"河梁意不尽，相送到真州。\n草木成今别，江山是昔游。\n各言衰鬓客，那忍故园秋。\n明发东西恨，惟看一水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行黄石望壶公山","author":"皇甫濂","text":"无能屏纷杂，聊与问山椒。\n日势消峦雾，江流到海潮。\n绿柔当社树，红发向阳翘。\n欲就壶公隐，鸾笙谁为招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻静安寺方丈","author":"皇甫濂","text":"客思随幽讨，僧堂到夕曛。\n晴悬千嶂雨，寒抱一丘云。\n草落犹花发，山空自鸟群。\n亦知禅寂处，秋色转氛氲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七里陇","author":"皇甫濂","text":"入陇澹晨旭，舟行夹翠微。\n惊湍堕峦色，连岫引江霏。\n水木淹停策，云霞系客衣。\n从知人去后，堪忆在渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离思","author":"皇甫濂","text":"爱于人境远，转与道门亲。\n静得幽探趣，闲耽逸性真。\n鹤巢低树色，燕乳落花尘。\n莫问忘言处，明朝是别辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日要王子饮双松道院","author":"皇甫濂","text":"命尔芳樽酌，同君物外踪。\n药栏华碧草，鹤径老青松。\n鸟爱留春语，云多入夏容。\n桃源未可问，兹地暂吾从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟入石湖烟雨成汛","author":"皇甫濂","text":"烟色含微雨，秋声起暮涛。\n水行天共远，云触岫同高。\n小泛随渔笠，闲情寄野醪。\n无令怀往事，翻益思偏劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅花","author":"皇甫濂","text":"坐惜江南树，春当塞北花。\n丛中澹芳色，歌里逗年华。\n竞月宜香泛，娇风恰影斜。\n佳人正堪忆，持此代疏麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡中作寄三兄","author":"皇甫濂","text":"海邑罕人事，炎天少雁声。\n林含丹荔发，泽蔓紫兰生。\n岩霭山头薄，溪云水上行。\n东菑正堪务，南国若为情。\n感念同棨服，吁嗟阻寇兵。\n迢迢思万里，今夕月还明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"皇甫濂","text":"岁尽方看老却身，更将幽思早惊春。\n东郊节候林端见，南国山川镜里新。\n宴赏移时淹醉客，笙歌满路起游尘。\n亦随景物消愁寂，愿得春风长与人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]